'''335''' was an [[A500]]-type [[synth]] unit. 

He assisted the [[Confederation magistrate 001|Confederation Magistrate]] in preparing [[Confederation of Earth]] [[President]] [[Annika Hansen]] on the morning of [[Eradication Day]] in an [[alternate timeline|alternate]] [[2401]]. ({{PIC|Penance}})
{{bginfo|335 was played by [[Alex Diehl]], who only received credit for playing [[Harvey]] in the same episode.}}
